sequenceDiagram
    participant CI as CI/CD Pipeline
    participant Extractor as model-extractor<br/>(Go CLI)
    participant HF as HuggingFace API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GH as GitHub API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Reg as Container Registries<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>data/*.yaml
    participant Build as Container Build<br/>(Dockerfile.konflux)
    participant Container as Data Container<br/>(ubi9-minimal)
    participant Platform as RHOAI Platform<br/>Components

    Note over CI,Reg: Flow 1: Build-Time Catalog Generation

    CI->>Extractor: Execute model-extractor
    Extractor->>HF: GET /api/collections<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN (optional)
    HF-->>Extractor: Model metadata JSON
    Extractor->>GH: GET /repos/.../contents<br/>Auth: Bearer GITHUB_TOKEN (optional)
    GH-->>Extractor: Agent metadata, READMEs
    Extractor->>Reg: OCI manifest requests<br/>Auth: System credential chain
    Reg-->>Extractor: Image architectures, OCI metadata
    Extractor->>FS: Write generated YAML catalogs<br/>(models, MCP servers, agents)

    Note over Build,Container: Container Image Build

    Build->>FS: COPY data/*.yaml
    Build->>Container: Build ubi9-minimal image<br/>CMD ["sleep", "infinity"]

    Note over Container,Platform: Flow 2: Runtime Data Consumption

    Platform->>Container: Volume mount /app/data
    Container-->>Platform: YAML catalog files<br/>(filesystem read, no network)
